   "details": "red plume, gold-trimmed great helm with visor slit and crest, gold pauldron trim and knee cops, brown belt with gold buckle, leather tasset and gauntlets, brown boots, sword in his right hand (screen-left in the down view) and the brown kite shield with steel rim from knightWithShieldAndSword.png on his left arm, gold slash arc from knightAttack.png",
