   "weak": "- Down/up hurt recoil is mostly foreshortened (leaning back toward the camera reads as a small squash); the flash frames carry the hit there.\n- The gold slash arc is a flat ribbon: it reads well in left/right, but in down/up it looks like a thin diagonal streak.\n- The sword blade is 2 px wide at game size and the visor slit is 1-2 px, so fine helm detail is simplified compared with the 1024 px reference.\n- Side-view walk feet land on rows 87-91 (toe-down tilt from the 12 deg camera), so there is up to 2 px of foot jitter around the ground line."
